  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can perceive the powers of darkness of all kinds, not only those from beyond the grave.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Sin Seer<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use your detect evil or detect undead ability, you may choose to gain the benefit of both effects simultaneously. You may instead choose to detect evil or detect undead instead of both effects; if you do so, you gain the effect of mythic detect evil or mythic detect undead.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc59\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
